OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Ffurther showers over western and
OL,7,Fnorthern hills this evening and
OL,8,Fovernight. Elsewhere, it will be
OL,9,Fmostly dry with clear spells. Winds
OL,10,Feasing to become light inland, but it
OL,11,Fwill remain breezy near the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FStaying cloudy with the odd
OL,14,Flight shower over western hills
OL,15,Fhowever elsewhere will be mostly dry
OL,16,Fwith bright or sunny spells. Moderate
OL,17,Fwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
